d":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"劉陶","kind":"person","person_id":"icd_he2_xzh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0124","start":124,"end":125,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0135","start":135,"end":136,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0137","start":137,"end":138,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0160","start":160,"end":161,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"劉琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"劉粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"謐","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0188","start":188,"end":189,"surface":"詵","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":64,"last_line":64,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","raw_start":5238,"raw_end":5441,"raw_line":64},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-ying:p008","text":"穎既廢，河北思之。鄴中故將公師籓、汲桑等起兵以迎穎，眾情翕然。顒復拜穎鎮軍大將軍、都督河北諸軍事，給兵千人，鎮鄴。穎至洛，而東海王越率眾迎大駕，所在鋒起。穎以北方盛強，懼不可進，自洛陽奔關中。值大駕還洛，穎自華陰趨武關，出新野。帝詔鎮南將軍劉弘、南中郎將劉陶收捕穎，於是棄母妻，單車與二子廬江王普、中都王廓渡河赴朝歌，收合故將士數百人，欲就公師籓。頓丘太守馮嵩執穎及普、廓送鄴，范陽王虓幽之，而無他意。屬虓暴薨，虓長史劉輿見穎為鄴都所服，慮為後患，秘不發喪，偽令人為臺使，稱詔夜賜穎死。穎謂守者田徽曰：「范陽王亡乎？」徽曰：「不知。」穎曰：「卿年幾？」徽曰：「五十。」穎曰：「知天命不？」徽曰：「不知。」穎曰：「我死之後，天下安乎不安乎？我自放逐，於今三年，身體手足不見洗沐，取數斗湯來！」其二子號泣，穎敕人將去。乃散發東首臥，命徽縊之，時年二十八。二子亦死。鄴中哀之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":163,"last_line":163,"raw_start":16697,"raw_end":17084,"raw_character_offsets":[16699,16700,16701,16702,16703,16704,16705,16706,16707,16708,16709,16710,16711,16712,16713,16714,16715,16716,16717,16718,16719,16720,16721,16722,16723,16724,16725,16726,16727,16728,16729,16730,16731,16732,16733,16734,16735,16736,16737,16738,16739,16740,16741,16742,16743,16744,16745,16746,16747,16748,16749,16750,16751,16752,16753,16754,16755,16756,16757,16758,16759,16760,16761,16762,16763,16764,16765,16766,16767,16768,16769,16770,16771,16772,16773,16774,16775,16776,16777,16778,16779,16780,16781,16782,16783,16784,16785,16786,16787,16788,16789,16790,16791,16792,16793,16794,16795,16796,16797,16798,16799,16800,16801,16802,16803,16804,16805